      "source_xml_line": 2140,
      "string_id": "otshel_obmen_dialog_phrase_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Well, it so happens I am interested in some specifics.. How about it?",
      "JA_current": "実はいくつか欲しい物があってな……取引できるか？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "otshel_obmen_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:otshel_obmen_dialog_phrase_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2143,
      "string_id": "otshel_obmen_dialog_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Oh yeah? What exactly do you want?",
      "JA_current": "ほう？ 具体的に何が要るんだい？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "otshel_obmen_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:otshel_obmen_dialog_phrase_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2146,
      "string_id": "otshel_obmen_dialog_phrase_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Equipment. Useful for long hikes in the Zone. ",
      "JA_current": "装備品だ。ゾーンの長旅に耐えうる実用的なものがいい。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "otshel_obmen_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:otshel_obmen_dialog_phrase_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2149,
      "string_id": "otshel_obmen_dialog_phrase_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I suppose we could work something out. But to begin with, I don't charge money for my goods. Don't ask me why, it's because I have to. Of course, I'm not running a charity either, because I got these things with great difficulty and risk. So, I deal exclusively in exchange for artifacts, don't bother guessing what I do with those. I cut a profit, and that's it. You can bring me as many as you like! If I like an artifact that you're carrying, I'll give you a useful piece of kit in exchange, all sorts of useful trinkets. Ask, and maybe I'll have something like that.",
      "JA_current": "それなら何とか用立てられそうだ。だが最初に言っておくが、品物に現金は受け取らない。理由は聞くな、そうせざるを得ない事情があるんだ。もちろん慈善事業じゃない、危険を冒して必死で仕入れた品だからな。取引はアーティファクトとの物々交換限定だ。何に使うかは詮索無用、俺も稼がなきゃならんのでね。持てるだけ持ってきてくれ！ 気に入ったアーティファクトがあれば、旅に役立つ装備や小道具と交換してやるよ。何が欲しいか言ってみな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "otshel_obmen_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:otshel_obmen_dialog_phrase_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2152,
      "string_id": "otshel_obmen_dialog_phrase_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "All right, let's get a weapon repair kit.",
      "JA_current": "よし、武器の修理キットをもらおう。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
